{
  "name": "04 - Risk Validation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 · Risk Validation\n\nThe deterministic gate. `/risk/check` re-resolves equity, exposure, drawdown, spread and liquidity **server-side** — values in the payload cannot inflate the account.\n\nIt checks exposure, position count, daily loss, drawdown, cooldown, confidence, reward/risk, spread, liquidity and the mandatory stop, then sizes the trade.\n\nOn approval it issues a **single-use approval id**. Execution is impossible without one.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "558151d8-d832-5a54-ba1d-02fa65487e41",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "risk-validation",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8d22fd43-5a17-5ae3-919e-d0c3354e16a4",
      "name": "Proposal received",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        140
      ],
      "webhookId": "3c204960-978f-565f-9d00-36a87d0b6eb5",
      "notes": "POST /webhook/risk-validation",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Reject calls that do not carry the shared internal secret. These webhooks are\n// reachable from anywhere n8n is reachable, so an unauthenticated caller must not\n// be able to push a trade into the pipeline.\nconst expected = ($env.WORKFLOW_SECRET || $env.SERVICE_API_KEY || 'dev-secret');\nconst items = $input.all();\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of items) {\n  const headers = item.json.headers || {};\n  const supplied = headers['x-workflow-secret'] || headers['X-Workflow-Secret'];\n  if (!supplied || supplied !== expected) {\n    throw new Error('unauthorized: missing or invalid x-workflow-secret header');\n  }\n  const body = item.json.body || item.json;\n  if (!body.proposal) { throw new Error('proposal is required'); }\n  out.push({ json: body });\n}\nreturn out;\n"
      },
      "id": "c22ef572-934a-5333-87cb-b64f8d25ac31",
      "name": "Validate request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        140
      ],
      "notes": "Shared-secret check on the inbound webhook",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.TRADING_API_BASE_URL || 'http://python-trading-service:8000' }}/risk/check",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.proposal) }}"
      },
      "id": "1c6be67d-7473-5a46-a087-b08be6f7d3d4",
      "name": "Risk check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        480,
        140
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "trading-api-key",
          "name": "Trading API Key"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "notes": "Deterministic. Same inputs ⇒ same verdict.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "approved",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.decision }}",
              "rightValue": "APPROVED",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b6f06cb4-8d6c-5156-a67a-d05d5eac6fa6",
      "name": "Approved?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        720,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const decision = $input.first().json;\nif (!decision.approval_id) {\n  throw new Error('approved decision carried no approval_id — refusing to execute');\n}\nreturn [{ json: {\n  risk_approval_id: decision.approval_id,\n  symbol: decision.symbol,\n  direction: decision.direction,\n  quantity: decision.sizing?.quantity ?? null,\n  notional: decision.sizing?.notional ?? null,\n  risk_pct: decision.sizing?.effective_risk_pct ?? null,\n  expires_at: decision.expires_at,\n} }];\n"
      },
      "id": "695fcfd7-9886-53d0-a60c-8ed2d148013b",
      "name": "Build execution request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.N8N_WEBHOOK_URL || 'http://localhost:5678/' }}webhook/trade-execution",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyHeaders": "keypair",
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-workflow-secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.WORKFLOW_SECRET || $env.SERVICE_API_KEY || 'dev-secret' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ risk_approval_id: $json.risk_approval_id, symbol: $json.symbol, source: 'workflow-04' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "81426b28-4d6e-546e-84e0-3558b356517a",
      "name": "Execute trade",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1200,
        60
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const decision = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  outcome: 'rejected',\n  symbol: decision.symbol,\n  direction: decision.direction,\n  codes: decision.rejection_codes || [],\n  reasons: decision.reasons || [],\n  failed_checks: (decision.checks || []).filter((c) => !c.passed).map((c) => c.name),\n  at: new Date().toISOString(),\n} }];\n"
      },
      "id": "55550353-8c71-57a4-be4f-2754708ec0e0",
      "name": "Record rejection",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        240
      ],
      "notes": "Rejections are logged server-side and shown on the dashboard",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.TRADING_API_BASE_URL || 'http://python-trading-service:8000' }}/workflow/error",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({workflow: $workflow.name, message: 'risk check request failed: ' + ($json.error?.message || 'unknown error'), node: $json.node || null, execution_id: $execution.id, severity: 'CRITICAL', halt_bot: true, context: { error: $json.error || null } }) }}"
      },
      "id": "4be80119-a1e1-5344-8017-e94c299ae1de",
      "name": "Report risk check failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        720,
        340
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "trading-api-key",
          "name": "Trading API Key"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Failures are recorded server-side and surfaced on the dashboard",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "47c8a422-4976-5cb5-9dd2-3b61f33f63e3",
      "name": "No trade (risk engine unreachable)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        420
      ],
      "notes": "If risk cannot be evaluated, nothing trades — and the bot halts",
      "notesInFlow": true
    }
  ],
